{"about_the_game":"Doll.<br><br>My darling doll...<br><br>Your birth is nigh, so leave the cradle.<br><br>They plundered my body,<br>my limbs ripped off,<br>my eyes gouged.<br><br>To reclaim all, I give birth to you.<br><br>Awaken, my doll. It is time for battle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\uff1cGame Introduction\uff1e</h2>Dolls Nest is a 3D action game where you control a mecha girl as she explores the gigantic factory world of Hod on her journey to uncover the truth.<br>Hod, the world which you inhabit, is a massive crater crawling with armored units. Broken machines and ruined buildings are strewn across its landscape.<br>But fate can be cruel. You must scavenge the land for resources if you wish to survive in this ruined world.<br>Make use of the parts and items you find on your journey, and overcome the trials that lie before you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839430/extras/e5f9ab26cebf567d698cdaf45dd9eae5.avif?t=1766045027\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br><br><strong>\u25a0Combat</strong><br>Dodging and using weapons will consume energy.<br>Be sure to manage your energy well and avoid running out of energy in the middle of a fight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839430/extras/7d66d595f2b7cfda2c4ce65b5b43d87b.avif?t=1766045027\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br><br><strong>\u25a0Exploration</strong><br>Aim to defeat the area boss and discover new unexplored areas.<br>Some events may even trigger along the way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839430/extras/1d33b040d0bbae2d7a5b384bcf7a55c6.avif?t=1766045027\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br><br><strong>\u25a0Customization</strong><br>Frame Units are capable of changing out and customizing parts.<br>Select parts that are best suited for the situation at hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839430/extras/cc213d3a17b704bd824cae35fca2fc05.avif?t=1766045027\" width=600 height=338 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dolls Nest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1839430/d3a6f62cb2470e485479a0484f488304ef05580c.jpg"},{"name":"A Peaceful World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1839430/1c866533eec57f5642188eec24959a0d7e2d28cd.jpg"},{"name":"A New Queen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1839430/9e77af6636d963820e37b2a82d09a24b08595a33.jpg"},{"name":"The World is Yours","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1839430/917b2597f546107673ebe941d9f13a5895f647a0.jpg"},{"name":"Central Cavern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1839430/395e4da798318f5edd5640c9f343c42b740c6502.jpg"},{"name":"The Depths","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1839430/04449124b68d33b8437f0a63aac039befa55139e.jpg"},{"name":"The Ark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1839430/baffe12d8dac241753f238dc6330d634c216ad2d.jpg"},{"name":"The Upturned Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1839430/8005652128e64a9b351eedc81278c586f5d6c569.jpg"},{"name":"The Fault","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1839430/fbba902c15aa83768618a7f5039d8807b6f67d40.jpg"},{"name":"Water Treatment Levels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1839430/950521c9e9e93109e1cdf36b69577e7a31f5a00c.jpg"}],"total":29},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1839430?t=1766045027","backgr